WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.667
UI and UX are not the same thing.

2
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:14.000
Confusing them is one of the most common beginner mistakes.

3
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:24.667
UI stands for User Interface. What you can see and touch.

4
00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:30.667
UX stands for User Experience. The full quality of the journey.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.333
Beautiful form, confusing to fill? That's great UI, terrible UX.

6
00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:47.667
Simple form, effortless to complete? Great UX, even if plain.

7
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:58.000
Great UI without great UX gets abandoned.

8
00:00:58.167 --> 00:01:03.333
Great UX with mediocre UI still creates loyal users.

9
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.667
The best products need both. Start learning at 0xverse Academy.

